flowchart TD
    Start[Enrollment Success OR User triggers voice cloning] --> AskExperiment{Ask: Would you like to<br/>experiment with voice cloning?}
    
    AskExperiment -->|User Affirms| AskWhoseVoice[Ask: Whose voice would<br/>you like to clone?]
    AskExperiment -->|User Denies| End[Exit Flow]
    
    AskWhoseVoice --> ReceiveName[Receive firstname<br/>or firstname + surname]
    
    ReceiveName --> QuerySpeakers[Query speakers table via<br/>SpeakerQueryRequest]
    
    QuerySpeakers --> CheckMatches{Check<br/>matches}
    
    CheckMatches -->|No Match| UtterNoMatch[Utter: I'm sorry I don't seem<br/>to know that speaker's voice]
    UtterNoMatch --> End
    
    CheckMatches -->|Multiple matches<br/>firstname only| AskSurname[Ask: What is the<br/>speaker's last name?]
    AskSurname --> ReceiveSurname[Receive surname]
    ReceiveSurname --> QuerySpeakers
    
    CheckMatches -->|Single Match| UtterGreat[Utter: Great!]
    UtterGreat --> SaveUID[Save match uid to<br/>slot 'voiceclone_uid']
    
    SaveUID --> QueryPassages[Query passages table for<br/>unique sources]
    
    QueryPassages --> AskSource[Ask: Would you like to hear a passage<br/>from source1, source2, or source3?]
    
    AskSource --> ReceiveSourceChoice[Receive user's<br/>source choice]
    
    ReceiveSourceChoice --> FuzzyMatch{Fuzzy match<br/>to sources}
    
    FuzzyMatch -->|No Match| AskSource
    
    FuzzyMatch -->|Match Found| SelectQuote[Select random quote from passages<br/>WHERE source = match]
    
    SelectQuote --> SendToWebsocket[Send uid + quote to<br/>websocket endpoint]
    
    SendToWebsocket --> ConvertAndSynthesize[Convert uid to speaker_name<br/>Call synthesize_xtts_audio<br/>via parallel_tts_pipeline]
    
    ConvertAndSynthesize --> PlayAudio[Stream audio to user]
    
    PlayAudio --> AskAnother{Ask: Would you like to<br/>hear another quote?}
    
    AskAnother -->|User Affirms| AskSource
    AskAnother -->|User Denies| End
    
    style Start fill:#1e3a8a,stroke:#60a5fa,stroke-width:3px,color:#fff
    style End fill:#7f1d1d,stroke:#f87171,stroke-width:3px,color:#fff
    style SaveUID fill:#14532d,stroke:#4ade80,stroke-width:3px,color:#fff
    style PlayAudio fill:#78350f,stroke:#fbbf24,stroke-width:3px,color:#fff
    style AskExperiment fill:#312e81,stroke:#a78bfa,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style CheckMatches fill:#312e81,stroke:#a78bfa,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style FuzzyMatch fill:#312e81,stroke:#a78bfa,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style AskAnother fill:#312e81,stroke:#a78bfa,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff